sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client as Web Client
    participant API as API Service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant DB as DB Proxy gRPC
    participant VWorker as ValidationWorker
    participant IWorker as InsertionWorker
    participant RWorker as ResultWorker
    participant Parser as Parsing Service

    note over Client, Parser: Phase 1: Idempotency Check and Task Registration

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/uploads/process (Spreadsheet + project_id + table_name + overwrite)
    activate API

    note over API: SHA-256 idempotency_key from<br/>user_id:project_id:table_name:file_hash:VALIDATION&INSERTION

    API->>PG: INSERT upload_tasks (status: PENDING, locked_until: now + 600s)

    alt EXCLUDE constraint violated — active task already exists in [PENDING, PUBLISHED] window
        PG-->>API: IntegrityError (uq_idempotency_key_active_window)
        API->>PG: SELECT existing task WHERE idempotency_key matches
        PG-->>API: Existing task (task_id + status)
        API-->>Client: HTTP 202 Already in progress (task_id + current status)
    else New task created successfully
        PG-->>API: task_id

        API->>MQ: Publish single ValidationMessage (insert=True, insert_db_uri, overwrite)

        alt Publish OK
            API->>PG: UPDATE status = PUBLISHED, locked_until = now + 1800s
            API->>DB: set_task_id (best-effort cache, Redis + MongoDB)
            note over API, DB: Cache failure is non-critical — DB is source of truth
        else RabbitMQ unavailable
            API->>PG: UPDATE status = PENDING, locked_until = now + 60s
            API-->>Client: HTTP 503 (AMQP error — retry later)
        end

        API-->>Client: HTTP 202 Accepted (task_id)
    end
    deactivate API

    note over MQ, VWorker: Phase 2: Async Validation (x-delivery-limit=3, x-message-ttl=1h)

    MQ-->>VWorker: Consume from typechecking.validation.queue
    activate VWorker

    VWorker->>DB: get_task_status (idempotency check)
    alt status in [success, error, completed]
        VWorker-->>MQ: ACK (skip — already completed)
    else status in [processing, validating-file, received]
        VWorker-->>MQ: ACK (skip — another worker has it)
    else status is null (first time)
        VWorker->>DB: set_task_id (status: received)
    end

    VWorker->>DB: update status → received-sample-validation
    VWorker->>DB: update status → processing-file
    VWorker->>DB: update status → validating-file

    note over VWorker: Polars in-memory validation<br/>against JSON Schema stored in MongoDB (via DB Proxy)

    alt Validation successful
        VWorker->>DB: update status → success
        VWorker->>MQ: Publish ResultsMessage → typechecking.results.queue
        note over VWorker: insert=True AND db_uri valid AND overwrite flag checked
        VWorker->>MQ: Publish InsertionMessage → typechecking.insertion.queue
    else Validation failed
        VWorker->>DB: update status → error
        VWorker->>MQ: Publish ResultsMessage (error) → typechecking.results.queue
    end

    VWorker-->>MQ: ACK
    deactivate VWorker

    note over MQ, IWorker: Phase 3a: Async Insertion (triggered only if validation succeeded)

    MQ-->>IWorker: Consume from typechecking.insertion.queue
    activate IWorker

    IWorker->>DB: get_task_status (idempotency check)
    IWorker->>DB: set_task_id (status: received — insertion task)
    IWorker->>Parser: REST — generate SQL statements from spreadsheet
    Parser-->>IWorker: SQL statements per sheet
    IWorker->>DB: update status → inserting
    note over IWorker: Execute SQL against target DB using project credentials
    IWorker->>DB: update status → success / error
    IWorker->>MQ: Publish ResultsMessage → typechecking.results.queue
    IWorker-->>MQ: ACK
    deactivate IWorker

    note over MQ, RWorker: Phase 3b: Result Notification (always executed after validation or insertion)

    MQ-->>RWorker: Consume from typechecking.results.queue
    activate RWorker

    RWorker->>DB: get_task_status (idempotency — skip if already completed)
    RWorker->>DB: update status → notifying
    RWorker->>API: POST /api/v1/events/task-completed (task_id, status, results)
    activate API
    API->>PG: UPDATE upload_tasks SET status = COMPLETED or FAILED
    PG-->>API: OK
    API-->>RWorker: HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate API
    RWorker->>DB: update status → completed
    RWorker-->>MQ: ACK
    deactivate RWorker

    note over Client, API: Phase 4: Result Retrieval

    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{task_id}
    activate API
    API->>PG: SELECT status FROM upload_tasks WHERE task_id = ?
    PG-->>API: Task status and metadata

    alt status PENDING or PUBLISHED
        API-->>Client: HTTP 200 (Processing...)
    else status COMPLETED or FAILED
        API-->>Client: HTTP 200 (Full report + results)
    end
    deactivate API
